BACKUP ~Shohy's_Custom_Platform/backup~
AUTHOR ~shohy@126.com~

VERSION ~v0.4~
AUTO_EVAL_STRINGS

README ~%MOD_FOLDER%/README.%LANGUAGE%.txt~
AUTO_TRA ~%MOD_FOLDER%/languages/%s~

ALWAYS	
	INCLUDE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/lib/_functions.tpa~
END


